<title>FINLAND: FEC SEES FIM 230 MLN FULL-YEAR 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>FEC SEES FIM 230 MLN FULL-YEAR 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned credit institute Finnish Export Credit Ltd (FEC) said in a statement on Thursday it expects its full-year 1996 pre-tax profit to be 230 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Based on the trends during the period under review, the current estimate for income, before changes in reserves and income taxes, for the whole of 1996 is 230 million markka,&quot; FEC said.</p>
<p>FEC's full-year 1995 pre-tax profit was 402 million markka.</p>
<p>Its January-June profit fell to 125 million markka from 158 million in H1 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
